{'symbol': 'IFF', 'date': '2022-12-19 03:00:00', 'title': 'IFF NAMES SABRYA MEFLAH PRESIDENT, FINE FRAGRANCE', 'text': "PARIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--IFF (NYSE: IFF) HAS NAMED SABRYA MEFLAH PRESIDENT OF ITS FINE FRAGRANCE BUSINESS UNIT, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. MEFLAH—WHO IS CURRENTLY VICE PRESIDENT AND REGIONAL GENERAL MANAGER, EUROPE, MIDDLE EAST, AFRICA (EMEA)—SUCCEEDS DIONISIO FERENC. IN HER NEW ROLE, SHE WILL OVERSEE STRATEGY AND GROWTH OF IFF'S FINE FRAGRANCE BUSINESS UNIT."}